
How to use (from folder = .):
compile badec: make badec3
compile undec: make undec3

run badec: ./badec -R path/to/archive.bdc -Q path/to/file/to/archivate
run undec: ./undec -R path/to/archive.bdc -Q path/to/folder/to/extract/files/ <- Note! All files in this folder will be overwritten

to change compression method on yours:
change code in huffman_code.c (do not touch huffman_code.h!)
(You may rename functions/files but do not forget to add changes to makefile and badec.c/undec.c)

In future I`ll refactor all this

P.S: Do not forget to work in your own branch